  "title": "Answer: observing is an interaction that destroys the particle",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "8a6669d1-9983-4b4d-a5b0-1194567de2fd",
      "text": "Observing a particle is interacting with it, which destroys the original particle by taking or passing states that cannot be fully controlled, so some of its properties cannot be known afterward.",
